{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-80855-r4518192","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Xató (Catalan Endives and Fish)","sourcePageId":80855,"sourceRevision":"4518192","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-21T16:15:52Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Xat%C3%B3%20(Catalan%20Endives%20and%20Fish)&oldid=4518192","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T16:29:26.986Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Easy recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for salad","Category:Recipes using almond","Category:Recipes using anchovy","Category:Recipes using bread","Category:Recipes using chicory","Category:Recipes using chile","Category:Recipes using cod","Category:Recipes using garlic","Category:Recipes using hazelnut","Category:Recipes using tuna","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Spanish recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"a252172c3bb6d9b37d24889fe9f81848e8b770e6e44c066552a9d7af238d14ff","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Salad recipes\n| Difficulty = 2\n}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Seafood|Seafood]]\n\n'''Xató''' is a typical Catalan dish.\n\n==Ingredients==\n\n=== Sauce ===\n\n* 100 g toasted [[Cookbook:Almond|almonds]]\n* 60 g toasted [[Cookbook:Hazelnut|hazelnuts]]\n* 2 cured anchovies, salt removed\n* 2 cloves [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]]\n* 4 pieces scalded [[Cookbook:Nyore|nyores]]\n* ½ piece [[Cookbook:Chiles|chile pepper]] (optional)\n* 2–3 slices fried or toasted [[Cookbook:Bread|bread]]\n* [[Cookbook:Vinegar|Vinegar]]\n* [[Cookbook:Olive Oil|Olive Oil]]\n* [[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]]\n\n=== Dish ===\n\n* 2 pieces [[Cookbook:Endive|curly endives]]\n* 12 pieces [[Cookbook:Anchovy|anchovies]], salt removed\n* 100 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]] [[Cookbook:Tuna|salty tuna]], salt removed\n* 100 g [[Cookbook:Cod|salty ripped cod]], salt removed\n* 100 g arbequine [[Cookbook:Olive|olives]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n#In a [[Cookbook:Mortar and Pestle|mortar]], crush the almonds, hazelnuts, anchovies, garlic cloves, nyores pulp, chili, salt, bread (you can soak them in vinegar or add the vinegar separately), vinegar, and salt.\n#Mix in the olive oil.\n#Wash and soak the curly endives in water.\n#Take the salt off the anchovies, the salty tuna, and the cod—rip the last two out—and mix them with the curly endive in a bowl.\n#Add the olives.\n#Add the sauce.\n#Mix it up well, so all the ingredients are coated with sauce. Serve, trying to build up some sort of curly endive castle shape.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using tuna]]\n[[Category:Spanish recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes_with_metric_units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using almond]]\n[[Category:Recipes using anchovy]]\n[[Category:Recipes for salad]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chile]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chicory]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cod]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bread]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]\n[[Category:Recipes using hazelnut]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Xató (Catalan Endives and Fish)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"100 g toasted almonds","sourceText":"100 g toasted almonds","amountText":"100 g toasted almonds","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"60 g toasted hazelnuts","sourceText":"60 g toasted hazelnuts","amountText":"60 g toasted hazelnuts","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 cured anchovies, salt removed","sourceText":"2 cured anchovies, salt removed","amountText":"2 cured anchovies, salt removed","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"2 cloves garlic","sourceText":"2 cloves garlic","amountText":"2 cloves garlic","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"4 pieces scalded nyores","sourceText":"4 pieces scalded nyores","amountText":"4 pieces scalded nyores","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"½ piece chile pepper (optional)","sourceText":"½ piece chile pepper (optional)","amountText":"½ piece chile pepper (optional)","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"2–3 slices fried or toasted bread","sourceText":"2–3 slices fried or toasted bread","amountText":"2–3 slices fried or toasted bread","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"Vinegar","sourceText":"Vinegar","amountText":"Vinegar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"Olive Oil","sourceText":"Olive Oil","amountText":"Olive Oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-10","name":"Salt","sourceText":"Salt","amountText":"Salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-11","name":"2 pieces curly endives","sourceText":"2 pieces curly endives","amountText":"2 pieces curly endives","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-12","name":"12 pieces anchovies, salt removed","sourceText":"12 pieces anchovies, salt removed","amountText":"12 pieces anchovies, salt removed","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-13","name":"100 g salty tuna, salt removed","source